servation process.\n\n<strong>3. Payment and Fees</strong>\n\n3.1. Payment details, including the total cost, deposit, and any additional fees, will be clearly communicated during the booking process.\n\n3.2. Payments are processed securely, and the website reserves the right to cancel a reservation if payment is not received within the specified timeframe.\n\n3.3. Any additional fees, such as cleaning fees or security deposits, will be outlined in the booking confirmation.\n\n<strong>4. Cancellation and Refund Policy</strong>\n\n4.1. Cancellation policies vary based on the property and are communicated during the booking process.\n\n4.2. Refunds may be subject to administrative fees or cancellation charges as specified in the cancellation policy.\n\n<strong>5. Property Information and Rules</strong>\n\n5.1. The website strives to provide accurate and up-to-date information about each vacation rental property. However, the website is not responsible for minor inaccuracies.\n\n5.2. Users must adhere to the specific rules and regulations set by the property owner or manager during their stay.\n\n<strong>6. User Responsibilities</strong>\n\n6.1. Users are responsible for any damage caused to the property during their stay and may be charged for repair or replacement costs.\n\n6.2. Users agree to respect the privacy and peaceful enjoyment of neighboring properties.\n\n<strong>7. Guest Verification</strong>\n\n7.1. For security and verification purposes, all guests are required to provide a copy of a government-issued photo ID (such as a passport or driver\'s license) prior to check-in.\n\n7.2. The ID or passport picture must be submitted through a secure online platform provided by the website. The information will be treated with the utmost confidentiality and used solely for the purpose of guest verification.\n\n7.3. Failure to provide the necessary identification may result in the cancellation of the reservation, and any payments made may be subject to the cancellation policy outlined in Section 4.\n\n7.4. The website reserves the right to refuse check-in if the guest\'s identification does not match the information provided during the reservation process.\n\n7.5. By submitting their identification, guests acknowledge and consent to the use of their personal information for verification purposes, in accordance with the website\'s privacy policy.\n\n<strong>8. Liability and Disclaimers</strong>\n\n8.1. The website is not liable for any loss, injury, or damage to persons or property during the use of the vacation rental.\n\n8.2. The website is not responsible for any disputes or issues arising between users and property owners or managers.\n\n<strong>9. Privacy Policy</strong>\n\n9.1. The website collects and uses personal information in accordance with its privacy policy, which is available on the website.\n\n<strong>10. Governing Law</strong>\n\n10.1. These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction where the property is located.\n\n<strong>11. Changes to Terms</strong>\n\n11.1. The website reserves the right to update or modify these terms and conditions at any time without prior notice.\n\nBy using this website, you agree to review these terms periodically and be aware of any modifications.\n<h2></h2>','Terms & Conditions','','publish','closed','closed','','terms-conditions','','','2023-12-18 01:42:45','2023-12-18 01:42:45','',0,'https://import.bellevuetheme.com/apartments/?page_id=2491',0,'page','',0),(98,1,'2019-03-19 11:39:43','2019-03-19 18:39:43','[mphb_availability_search]','Search Availability','','draft','closed','closed','','search-availability','','','2024-06-11 11:26:12','2024-06-11 11:26:12','',0,'https://import.bellevuetheme.com/apartments/search-availability/',0,'page','',0),(99,1,'2019-03-19 11:39:43','2019-03-19 18:39:43','<h1>\n                        Availability Search                    </h1>\n                                        <p></p>\n			      