ore info                                                                    </a>\n                    <h3>\n                        Steps From The Boulevard                    </h3>\n                                        <p>Outstanding Panoramic Views:  framing sweeping panoramic views of the Nile River flowing gracefully through the city. You can enjoy mesmerizing sunsets over the water and witness the city\'s vibrant lights twinkling at night.\n</p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/MaarofC/\">\n                                                                            More info                                                                    </a>\n                    <h3>\n                        Calm &amp; Tranquility                     </h3>\n                                        <p> This charming and cozy studio apartment is the perfect place for those seeking a tranquil retreat.</p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/el-rehab/\">\n                                                                            More info                                                                    </a>\n							We had a pleasant check-in, place was clean and cozy. The accommodation is in a great location and we felt very much at home. We will be happy to come back.\n													Meret\n													Digital nomad\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/downtown-cairo/\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>From 25 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            per night\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_7764-394x303.jpg\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>Downtown Cairo</h3>\n                        Immerse yourself in the vibrant energy of Downtown Cairo. Discover a range of modern accommodations, perfect for tourists, digital nomads, and business travelers alike. Experience the heart of the city with easy access to cultural attractions, shopping, and dining. Your stay in Downtown Cairo awaits - book now and make memories in this dynamic city!                    \n        </article>\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/alexandria/\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>From 25 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            per night\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/94344d78-6a35-47f7-9d22-1aaf2abb3dc2-394x303.jpg\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>Alexandria</h3>\n                        Discover the beauty of Alexandria. Book a cozy apartment, or a charming studio for your stay. Enjoy stunning views and modern amenities. Your perfect vacation in Alexandria awaits!\n        </article>\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/new-cairo\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>32 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            per night\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Garden-1-394x303.webp\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>New Cairo</h3>\n                        Experience the modern allure of New Cairo . Ideal for tourists, digital nomads, and business travelers. our accommodations offer contemporary comfort and convenience. Whether you\'re exploring the city or working remotely, find the perfect home away from home in New Cairo. Start your journey to m