p-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_5887-scaled.jpg\"><figure><img src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_5887-605x465.jpg\" alt=\"El rehab\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"455668d0\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Camp\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Mjc2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvbm9tYWRzaGl2ZS5jb21cL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjNcLzA3XC9JTUdfNTY4My1zY2FsZWQuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiNDU1NjY4ZDAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_5683-scaled.jpg\"><figure><img src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_5683-605x465.jpg\" alt=\"Camp\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"455668d0\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Garden\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjAxLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvbm9tYWRzaGl2ZS5jb21cL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjNcLzA1XC9HYXJkZW4tMS53ZWJwIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiNDU1NjY4ZDAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Garden-1.webp\"><figure><img src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Garden-1-605x465.webp\" alt=\"Garden\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"455668d0\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"Table\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Njc4LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvbm9tYWRzaGl2ZS5jb21cL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzAxXC82MTg3MWJkZi00MTE5LTQ1OGEtYWUzMi04ZGYyZTAxNDg4OTUtMS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0NTU2NjhkMCJ9\" href=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/61871bdf-4119-458a-ae32-8df2e0148895-1.jpg\"><figure><img src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/61871bdf-4119-458a-ae32-8df2e0148895-1-605x465.jpg\" alt=\"Table\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"455668d0\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"8970e48c-9c40-4506-8dba-9f4423c2d68e(2)\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Njc3LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvbm9tYWRzaGl2ZS5jb21cL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzAxXC84OTcwZTQ4Yy05YzQwLTQ1MDYtOGRiYS05ZjQ0MjNjMmQ2OGUyLmpwZWciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI0NTU2NjhkMCJ9\" href=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/8970e48c-9c40-4506-8dba-9f4423c2d68e2.jpeg\"><figure><img src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/8970e48c-9c40-4506-8dba-9f4423c2d68e2-605x465.jpeg\" alt=\"8970e48c-9c40-4506-8dba-9f4423c2d68e(2)\" /></figure></a>			\n                    <h3>\n                        Welcome to Cairo                    </h3>\n                                        <p>Welcome to a world of ancient wonders and modern marvels! Embrace the magic of Egypt with our exclusive vacation rental platform, designed to make your dream holiday an unforgettable reality.</p>\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RKzeyrlzwt4&#038;ab_channel=WorldTravelGuide		\n                    <h2>\n                        APARTMENTS                    </h2>\n                                        <p></p>\n                    <h3>\n                        Having a flight in few hours?                    </h3>\n                                        <p> This charming and cozy apartment is the perfect place for those seeking a tranquil retreat, before their next journey, 10 minutes away from Cairo international Airport.</p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/gardenia/\">\n                                                                            More info                                                                    </a>\n                    <h3>\n                        Steps From The Boulevard                    </h3>\n                                        <p>Outstanding Panoramic Views:  framing sweeping panoramic views of the Nile River flowing gracefully through the city. You can enjoy mesmerizing sunsets over the water and witness the city\'s vibrant lights twinkling at night.\n</p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/MaarofC/\">\n                                                                            More info                                                                    </a>\n                    <h3>\n                        Calm &amp; Tranquility                     </h3>\n                                        <p> This charming and cozy studio apartment is the perfect place for those seeking a tranquil retreat.</p>\n                                                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/el-rehab/\">\n                                                                            More info                                                                    </a>\n							We had a pleasant check-in, place was clean and cozy. The accommodation is in a great location and we felt very much at home. We will be happy to come back.\n													Meret\n													Digital nomad\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/MaarofC/\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>25 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            per Room\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_7764-394x303.jpg\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>The heart of the City Center</h3>\n                        With outstanding Panoramic Views: As you enter the apartment, large floor-to-ceiling windows immediately capture your attention, framing sweeping panoramic views of the Nile River flowing gracefully through the city. You can enjoy mesmerizing sunsets over the water and witness the city\'s vibrant lights twinkling at night.\n        </article>\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"#more\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>39 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            person\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"296\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/IMG_5683-394x296.jpg\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>Adventure</h3>\n                        Discover Wady Degla unique wilderness experience within the urban environment of Cairo. It is a popular destination for outdoor enthusiasts, hikers, and nature lovers who seek a respite from the city\'s hustle and bustle.                     \n        </article>\n        <article>\n                            <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/el-rehab/\"></a>\n                                                    <h4>32 EUR</h4>\n                                                                            per Studio\n                                <img width=\"394\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Garden-1-394x303.webp\" alt=\"\" />            \n                                                    <h3>Calm and tranquility </h3>\n                        Welcome to your second home in El Rehab City! This charming and cozy studio apartment is the perfect place for those seeking a tranquil retreat in the heart of this vibrant community. One of the standout features of this apartment is the lovely private garden, which provides a peaceful and serene outdoor space to enjoy. The garden is perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining friends, or simply enjoying a good book in the fresh air.\n        </article>\n                    <h2>\n                        QUESTIONS?                    </h2>\n                      