                                          <p>Starting from 35 EUR per night</p>                                    \n                                      <h3>Downtown Cairo 1BR Flat-63 A</h3>\n                                      <p>4 guests, 2 bedrooms, 1 bath</p>                                    \n                                    </a>\n                                <a href=\"https://example-site.com/accommodation/maarofc-2/\" >                                \n                                                            <img width=\"605\" height=\"605\" src=\"https://example-site.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Cover-605x605.jpg\" alt=\"\" />                                                                                                        \n                                      <h3>Apartment in Downtown With Nile View</h3>\n                                      <p>6 guests, 2 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 1 Showerroom</p>                                    \n                                    </a>','Downtown','','draft','closed','closed','','downtown-cairo','','','2024-06-11 11:26:12','2024-06-11 11:26:12','',0,'https://example-site.com/?page_id=1659',0,'page','',0),(1703,1,'2024-05-03 21:24:38','2024-05-03 21:24:38','<p>1. Introduction<br />Welcome to NomadsHive. These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of NomadsHive\'s Timeshare Property Management services, available at example.com.</p><p>## 2. Acceptance of Terms<br />By accessing and using the services provided by NomadsHive, you agree to be bound by these terms and conditions, all applicable laws and regulations, and agree that you are responsible for compliance with any applicable local laws.</p><p>## 3. Timeshare Property Management Services<br />NomadsHive offers a timeshare property management service that allows you to purchase a bundle of days to be used at any of our properties in the area of your choice, subject to availability.</p><p>### 3.1 Bundle of Days<br />- *Allocation*: Users will be allocated a number of days based on the package purchased.<br />- *Validity*: The days must be used within the calendar year and cannot be rolled over to the next year without prior agreement.</p><p>### 3.2 Property Selection<br />- *Choice of Area*: Users may choose from any of the available areas where NomadsHive properties are located. (As subjected to the selected bundle).</p><p><br />- *Booking*: Reservation of property days is subject to availability and must be made in advance through the NomadsHive platform.</p><p>## 4. User Obligations<br />- *Age Requirement*: Users must be at least 18 years old to enter into this agreement.<br />- *Compliance*: Users agree to use their days in accordance with the property rules and regulations.</p><p>## 5. Payment<br />- *Fees*: The fee for the timeshare bundle must be paid in full at the time of purchase.<br />- *Maintenance Fee*: An annual maintenance fee is applicable and must be paid at the beginning of each year.</p><p>## 6. Cancellation and Refund<br />- *Cancellation*: Users may cancel their timeshare bundle within 14 days of purchase for a full refund on condition that no days were used.<br />- *Refund*: No refunds will be provided for unused days unless the cancellation is made within the specified period.</p><p>## 7. Limitation of Liability<br />NomadsHive shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from the user\'s failure to comply with these terms and conditions.</p><p>## 8. Amendments<br />NomadsHive reserves the right to amend these terms and conditions at any time. Users will be notified of any changes through the platform\'s communication channels.</p><p>## 9. Governing Law<br />These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction where the property is located.</p><p>By using NomadsHive\'s timeshare property management services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms and conditions.</p>','Terms & Conditions Bundles','','publish','closed','closed','','terms-conditions-2','','','2024-05-03 21:37:05','2024-05-03 21:37:05','',0,'https://example-site.com/?page_id=1703',0,'page','',0),(1736,1,'2024-05-04 02:15:01','2024-05-04 02:15:01','','Checkout Page','','draft','closed','closed','','checkout-page','','','2024-06-11 11:26:12','2024-06-11 11:26:12','',0,'https://example-site.com/?page_id=1736',0,'page','',0),(1749,1,'2024-05-04 09:35:24','2024-05-04 09:35:24','{\"event\":[\"create\"],\"email_to\":\"[55]\",\"cc\":\"\",\"bcc\":\"\",\"from\":\"[sitename] <[admin_email]\",\"reply_to\":\"\",\"email_subject\":\"[52], Thank you for your purchase here is your contract\",\"email_message\":\"Thank you for your purchase here is your certificate of use.\\r\\n\\r\\n[display-frm-data id=\\\"1766\\\"]\",\"email_attachment_id\":\"\",\"conditions\":{\"send_stop\":\"send\",\"any_all\":\"any\"}}','Send Email','email','publish','closed','closed','','12_email_1749','','','2024-05-09 01:08:23','2024-05-09 01:08:23','',0,'https://example-site.com/frm_form_actions/12_email_/',12,'frm_form_actions','',0),(1750,0,'2023-03-10 10:05:18','2023-03-10 10:05:18','{\"event\":[\"create\"],\"success_action\":\"message\",\"success_msg\":\"Contract details successfully submitted. Thank you!\",\"success_url\":\"\",\"success_page_id\":\"\",\"conditions\":{\"send_stop\":\"send\",\"any_all\":\"any\"}}','Confirmation','on_submit','publish','closed','closed','','403_on_submit_1436','','','2023-03-10 10:05:18','2023-03-10 10:05:18','',0,'https://example-site.com/frm_form_actions/403_on_submit_1436/',13,'frm_form_actions','',0),(1751,0,'2023-03-10 10:05:18','2023-03-10 17:05:18','{\"email_to\":\"[admin_email]\",\"cc\":\"\",\"bcc\":\"\",\"from\":\"[sitename] <[admin_email]>\",\"reply_to\":\"\",\"email_subject\":\"\",\"email_message\":\"[default-message]\",\"inc_user_info\":\"0\",\"plain_text\":\"0\",\"event\":[\"create\"],\"conditions\":{\"send_stop\":\"\",\"any_all\":\"\"}}','Send Email','email','draft','closed','closed','','34_email_','','','2023-03-10 10:05:18','2023-03-10 17:05:18','',0,'https://example-site.com/?post_type=frm_form_actions&p=1751',13,'frm_form_actions','',0),(1752,0,'2023-04-25 20:24:52','2023-04-25 20:24:52','[{\"box\":0,\"content\":\"\"},{\"box\":1,\"content\":\"<p><strong>ACCOMMODATION AGREEMENT<\\/strong><\\/p><p>This Accommodation Agreement (\\\"Agreement\\\") is made and entered into on [62], between Nomads Hive Ltd., a company registered in England and Wales under company number [<strong>14879995<\\/strong>], whose registered office is at [71-75 Shelton Street, Covent Garden, London, United Kingdom, WC2H 9JQ] (hereinafter referred to as \\\"Provider\\\"), and [52] (hereinafter referred to as \\\"Client\\\"), collectively referred to as the \\\"Parties.\\\"<\\/p><p><strong>1. Term of Agreement<\\/strong><\\/p><p>1.1 The term of this Agreement shall commence on [87] and shall continue for a period of one year unless terminated earlier in accordance with the terms herein.<\\/p><p><strong>2. Accommodation Package<\\/strong><\\/p><p>2.1 Nomads Hive Ltd. agrees to grant the Client an accommodation package consisting of 60 days of accommodation in Egypt each year during the term of this Agreement.<\\/p><p>2.2 The price of the accommodation package shall increment annually, with the increment of 10% increase based on the previous year\'s price.<\\/p><p><strong>3. Reservation Procedure<\\/strong><\\/p><p>3.1 The Client shall reserve their preferred dates for accommodation in Egypt by filling out a reservation form provided by Nomads Hive Ltd. at least two weeks prior to their intended arrival date.<\\/p><p>3.2 Nomads Hive Ltd. shall make reasonable efforts to accommodate the Client\'s preferred dates, subject to availability.<\\/p><p><strong>4. Accommodation<\\/strong><\\/p><p>4.1 Nomads Hive Ltd. shall offer the Client an apartment in Egypt that includes, at a minimum, the following amenities: a) WIFI b) Accommodation for up to 4 persons<\\/p><p>4.2 Nomads Hive Ltd. reserves the right to add additional amenities to the apartment as deemed necessary.<\\/p><p><strong>5. Payment Terms<\\/strong><\\/p><p>5.1 The Client shall pay the full amount for the accommodation package annually in advance.<\\/p><p>5.2 Any additional charges incurred by the Client during their stay, such as utility charges or damages to the property, shall be paid by the Client upon receipt of an invoice from Nomads Hive Ltd.<\\/p><p><strong>6. Transfer of Days<\\/strong><\\/p><p>6.1 The Client may transfer unused days from their accommodation package to another year by submitting a transfer request to Nomads Hive Ltd. at least 2 weeks prior to the end of the current year.<\\/p><p>6.2 Nomads Hive Ltd. shall confirm the transfer of days to the Client within a reasonable time frame.<\\/p><p><strong>7. Termination<\\/strong><\\/p><p>7.1 Either party may terminate this Agreement upon written notice to the other party in the event of a material breach of the terms herein.<\\/p><p><strong>8. Force Majeure<\\/strong><\\/p><p>8.1 Neither party shall be liable for any failure or delay in performing their obligations under this Agreement to the extent that such failure or delay is caused by circumstances beyond their reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, war, terrorism, or natural disasters.<\\/p><p><strong>9. Governing Law and Jurisdiction<\\/strong><\\/p><p>9.1 This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes arising under or in connection with this Agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.<\\/p><p><strong>10. Compliance with Local Laws<\\/strong><\\/p><p>10.1 The Parties agree to comply with all laws and regulations applicable to the properties in Egypt where the accommodation is located.<\\/p>\"},{\"box\":3,\"content\":\"\"},{\"box\":5,\"content\":\"\"}]','Contract Agreement Generator Gr